==Icelandic==

===Adverb===
{{is-adv|lengra|lengst}}

# {{lb|is|distance}} [[far]]
#: ''Við gengum ekki mjög '''langt''' sko.''
#:: We really didn't really walk that '''far'''.
#: ''Svo '''langt''' sem það nær.''
#:: As '''far''' as it goes.
#: ''Gunnar gekk '''langt''', en Hildur gekk '''lengst'''.''
#:: Gunnar walked '''far''' but Hildur walked '''farthest'''.
#: ''Ertu að fara '''langt'''?''
#:: Are you going '''far'''?
# {{lb|is|time}} [[late]], [[long]]
#: {{ux|is|Við horfðum á sjónvarp '''langt''' fram á nótt.|We watched television '''late''' into the night.}}
# {{lb|is|quantity}} [[much]]
#: {{ux|is|Sófinn er '''langt''' of stór!|The sofa is '''much''' too big!}}

